      "body": "每个人都能向数据库询问业务问题，获得答案并从中受益。\n\n\n官网：\nhttps://vanna.ai/\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2727b346-1669-455b-90cb-6e269cf0ad22)\n\n\n示例图片\n能持续学习，每次提问或标记都可提升\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f93c783-eeb3-4072-b4b5-353f4ff80293)\n能快速生成SQL，作图进行数据分析\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a8863b0-bd23-4e93-a1dc-4c4d92a6625a)",
